The bounded scientific conclusions are supported:

| Channel | \|B3−A3\|/B3 | Raw h–dt interaction |
|---|---:|---:|
| P1 | 3.292486571% | 5.456046119×10⁻⁶ |
| P2 | 3.064521476% | 6.697127031×10⁻⁶ |
